{"id":"n67507-1-7","stage":5,"title":"연말연시 · 岁末年初","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67507-1-7-1","ko":"우리 회사는 이번에는 송년회를 안 하나 봐.","zh":"我们公司这次好像不办年终聚会了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"회사는","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사는","audio":"/audio/07eea830806c343675fd.mp3"}},{"text":"이번에는","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번에는","audio":"/audio/11decb5783cf7f4ba462.mp3"}},{"text":"송년회를","meaning":"送年会，年会","explanation":"송년회：送年会，年会；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"송년회","audio":"/audio/f1d9c4f5bf4c336eda3d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64664","senseId":"1","lemma":"송년회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"송년회를","audio":"/audio/73ee37ec7396cc650fd8.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"하나","meaning":"决定","explanation":"하다：决定；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"16","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"f1d9c4f5bf4c336e","term":"송년회","zh":"送年会，年会","audio":"/audio/f1d9c4f5bf4c336eda3d.mp3","entryId":"64664","definition":"年末时和家人、朋友或同事等一起欢送一年而举行的集会。","pronunciation":["송ː년회","송ː년훼"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"决定","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"把某事定下来。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cf8432ee17e038a5b2ee.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67507-1-7-2","ko":"경기가 안 좋아서 연말연시 행사를 줄이기로 했대.","zh":"因为经济形势不佳，所以决定减少年末年初的各类活动。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"경기가","meaning":"经济状况","explanation":"경기：经济状况；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"s